@startuml
[*] --> "Waiting for Preferences"
"Waiting for Preferences" --> "Preferences Input" : User inputs preferences
"Preferences Input" --> "Generating Recommendations" : System processes preferences
"Generating Recommendations" --> "Displaying Product Details" : Recommendations generated
"Displaying Product Details" --> [*] : User views details and exits
"Displaying Product Details" --> "Saving Preferences" : User chooses to save preferences
"Saving Preferences" --> "Waiting for Preferences" : Preferences saved for future use
@enduml
